# INVERSE (ADR-054): Up from BALL wraps to COLORS; INVERSE on, keep with B.
# A doubles match against DAD and MOM in a photo negative; the HUD and the
# shadows keep their colours. Then back to the title (Start, MAIN MENU),
# which must show its own colours again.
70 71 up       # wraps to MODIFIERS (ADR-065)
90 91 start
110 111 up     # COLORS
120 121 right  # INVERSE
shot 135
140 141 b
160 161 down   # MODIFIERS -> SINGLES -> DOUBLES
166 167 down
180 181 start
220 221 start  # confirm Player Select
300 301 b      # close the intro card
330 345 b      # serve: hold for the meter (ADR-044)
shot 400
420 435 b      # serve, if the card took the first press
shot 470
shot 500
shot 600
620 621 start  # pause
640 641 down
650 651 down
670 671 b      # MAIN MENU: the title in its own colours
shot 760
shot 900
